#: Parallelization.ipynb:88
msgid "To see this in action, let's backtest a moving average crossover:"
msgstr "为了实际演示这一点，让我们回测一个移动平均线交叉策略："

#: ../../source/notebooks/11. 67ce78210f3c401b8128665fec2f95fd Configuring
#: Parallelization.ipynb:441
msgid ""
"Standalone indicator computation with an `IndicatorSet "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.IndicatorSet>`__"
" accepts the same ``parallel_indicators`` flag:"
msgstr ""
"使用 `IndicatorSet "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.IndicatorSet>`__"
" 进行独立的指标计算时，同样接受相同的 ``parallel_indicators`` 标志："

#: ../../source/notebooks/11. 65c6931e41e64d189db0802893c886d9 Configuring
#: Parallelization.ipynb:658
msgid "Parallel Model Training"
msgstr "并行模型训练"

#: ../../source/notebooks/11. 083d8da2eac44a2d9c778599ebf58413 Configuring
#: Parallelization.ipynb:660
msgid ""
"Model training runs serially by default. Passing ``parallel_models=True``"
" to `backtest "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`__"
" or `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" trains each model in its own task across the configured workers."
msgstr ""
"模型训练默认按顺序运行。向 `backtest "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`__"
" 或 `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" 传入 ``parallel_models=True``，会让每个模型在已配置的工作进程中以各自独立的任务进行训练。"

